      "created_at": "2015-02-03T15:36:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Well...</p><p>I contacted Craig to update shipping on my order. Everything was good.</p><p>...until the package was delivered to my address in Michigan while I'm in Colorado. Luckily, I've got a cousin watching the house so the package got in the house instead of being left out for months.</p><p>Was really hoping for delivery before Christmas, as expected, since I got my son...addicted to the game over Thanksgiving.</p>",
