      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/craig/{size}/2150_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-02-03T21:39:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Greywind\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/greywind/48/2006_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Greywind:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Well…I contacted Craig to update shipping on my order. Everything was good…until the package was delivered to my address in Michigan while I'm in Colorado. Luckily, I've got a cousin watching the house so the package got in the house instead of being left out for months.Was really hoping for delivery before Christmas, as expected, since I got my son…addicted to the game over Thanksgiving.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yeah, that was super unfortunate. It appears that several of the addresses that I updated in our system didn't get taken into account by FedEx. I'll be a little more forceful in the future.</p>",
